Package: gamfluence
Type: Package
Title: Deletion Influence Diagnostics for Penalised Additive Models Fitted with 'mgcv'
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Ziqi", "Song", email = "ziqisong030@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: For penalised additive (mixed) models fitted with mgcv::gam(),
    deletes each site (cluster) in turn and refits the model twice on the
    frozen full-data representation: with the estimated smoothing parameters
    (and negative binomial theta) held fixed, and with them re-estimated. The
    changes in the other sites' fitted values are compared, showing how much
    of a site's influence appears only when the hyperparameters re-tune.
    Deliberately narrow scope; see the package README.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/FayeSong-0223/gamfluence
BugReports: https://github.com/FayeSong-0223/gamfluence/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: graphics, mgcv (>= 1.9), stats, utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.1.7)
